  "body": "A move-in-ready, substantial Glendowie residence sure to appeal to value-conscious buyers. With expansive Hauraki Gulf views, generous family accommodation and a premium coastal position, the amount of property on offer deserves serious consideration. The vendors' instructions are clear. They want this sold.\r\n\r\n* Four generous bedrooms plus a substantial study on the lower level provide excellent accommodation for families of all ages.\r\n\r\n* Two separate living areas, including a lower-level kitchenette, offer flexibility for teenagers, guests or extended family. Downstairs could also be used as a business space with separate entry.\r\n\r\n* Sweeping views across Tahuna Torea and the Hauraki Gulf from the main living spaces and elevated balcony.\r\n\r\n* Generous outdoor space with existing plans for a swimming pool.\r\n\r\n* Extensive off-street parking accommodates boats, recreational equipment and additional vehicles.\r\n\r\n* Zoned for Glendowie Primary and Glendowie College, with Sacred Heart College an easy walk away.\r\n\r\n* A well-established coastal neighbourhood with beaches, reserves and local amenities close by.\r\n\r\nTake a fresh look, particularly for buyers who may have previously considered this property beyond their budget. The owners are realistic, motivated, and are engaging with the market.\r\n\r\nYour earliest inspection is recommended. All genuine offers are encouraged.",
